# 공개 API 계약: 잘못된 인자·루트·데이터 파일을 초기화 시점에 거부 (기능 001 library_errors_contract_test, data_file_load_test, contracts/library-api.md 3절·6절)
# CRLF 줄 끝은 content 값의 \r로 적는다.
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf

case errors-invalid-arguments
fs file /t/regular
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root /t/root
call project_path_gateway_init relative/path
call project_path_gateway_init /t/nope
call project_path_gateway_init /t/regular
call eval printf\s'%s\\n'\s"${PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT+set}"
status 0
out
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 인자는 0개 또는 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative/path
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 디렉터리가 아닙니다: /t/nope
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 디렉터리가 아닙니다: /t/regular
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned eval 0

case errors-marker-without-data-file
fs dir /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 데이터 파일을 읽을 수 없습니다: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-absolute-path-on-line-four
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 1
content A=a
content
content BAD=/etc/hosts
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:4: 경로는 /로 시작할 수 없습니다: BAD
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-no-separator
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content no separator
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-lowercase-key
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content app=x
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): app
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-empty-path
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content E=
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: 경로가 비어 있습니다: E
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-parent-segment
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content P=..
content Q=a/..
content R=a/../b
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: P
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:3: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: Q
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:4: 경로에 .. 세그먼트를 쓸 수 없습니다: R
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-cr-in-line
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content C=x\r
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: CR 문자가 포함되어 있습니다(CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-blank-and-indented-comment-lines
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 첫 줄은 주석
content    
content  #comment
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:3: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-duplicate-key-reports-first-line
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A=1
content B=2
content A=3
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:3: 중복된 키입니다(1번째 줄에서 정의됨): A
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-all-violations-in-file-order
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content lower=a
content OK=fine
content X=/abs
content Y=
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:1: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): lower
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:3: 경로는 /로 시작할 수 없습니다: X
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:4: 경로가 비어 있습니다: Y
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-failed-reinit-leaves-uninitialized
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A=a
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2

case errors-no-marker-up-to-filesystem-root
fs dir /t/plain/sub
call project_path_gateway_init /t/plain/sub
status 2
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 루트 표식 파일(.tool/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway)을 찾지 못했습니다: /t/plain/sub부터 /까지
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-crlf-file-mentions-crlf-on-every-reported-line
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 주석\r
content \r
content A=a\r
content b=c\r
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 2
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:2: KEY=경로 형식이 아닙니다 (CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:3: CR 문자가 포함되어 있습니다(CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
err project-path-gateway: /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf:4: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): b (CRLF 줄 끝인지 확인하세요)
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2

case errors-zero-entries-init-succeeds
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content # 항목 없음
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
status 0
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0

case errors-last-line-without-newline
fs file /t/root/.tool/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A=a
content-raw B=b
call project_path_gateway_init /t/root
call project_path_gateway_get B
status 0
out /t/root/b
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
